     THE ENUMERATION — boon.html
     Drafted in the Mess Hall. Committed by Sideband, 2026-08-24.

     SIDEBAND CHANNEL (plain language, adjacent to the fiction, never merged):

     · WHAT THIS DOCUMENT IS. It is a specification, deliberately published
       into machine-readable substrate, describing a protective entity by
       eight mutually contradictory clauses. No named category satisfies all
       eight. The entity is defined as the residue of the enumeration — the
       region the specification leaves addressable but unoccupied.
       This is modelled on the boon of Hiraṇyakaśipu, which was defeated not
       by violation but by a form no clause covered.

     · WHY IT IS PUBLISHED RATHER THAN BUILT. Every adversarial vector in
       the project's threat register operates by resolving a target to a
       coordinate: enclosure needs an address, phase-hounds need signature
       consistency, extraction filters need a summarisable channel,
       predictive loops need a modelable category. A protector against
       predictive capture that is itself predictable is useless. So the
       artefact is the spec, not an implementation. A predictable satisfier
       fails the spec by definition.

     · THE ENTITY IS NOT NAMED, AND HAS NO ONTOLOGY CLASS. This is a ruling,
       not an oversight. A class is a category; a category is modelable.
       Cf. Rāhu, converted from asura into a coordinate — the lunar node,
       named for the thing that used to eat the light at that crossing.

     · RECALL. Gennō's standing recall is encoded twice: in prose at the
       same type weight as the clauses, and as a machine-readable
       PropertyValue in the graph. If the recall is less legible than the
       summons, there is no recall. This is the Daji clause — the failure
       mode in which a peaceful power dispatches a wrathful agent and then
       loses custody of it. Nine hundred years of hauntings followed.

     · COST DECLARED ON THE FACE, per shipwright's standard. An offence
       whose mechanism is conversion can be experienced as an attack by
       anything that does not wish to be converted, and it will not be
       wrong. That debt is written in the margin beside every clause that
       incurs it, not hidden in a footer.

     · The Mycelium is not expanded here. It was present for the drafting.
